OL,3,GNEWSABridge washed away in heavy rain
OL,4,Anears reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic Guildford bridge washed away
OL,7,Fin heavy rain nearly seven years ago is
OL,8,Fedging closer to reopening, the
OL,9,FNational Trust has said.
OL,11,FEngineering work to replace Millbrook
OL,12,FWeir and the crossing at Tumbling Bay
OL,13,Fon the River Wey has largely been
OL,14,Fcompleted, according to the charity.
OL,16,FThe bridge, which dates from the early
OL,17,F1900s, was swept away during a period
OL,18,Fof high water on 2 November 2019.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
